rows":[{"label":"One-sample matroid prophet inequality against an almighty adversary","statements":["MatroidProphet"]},{"label":"Hidden-vector matroid selection with worst-order guarantee","statements":["MatroidSecretary"]}],"scope":"The formalization proves a one-sample matroid prophet inequality with expected reward at least $2^{-310}$ times the expected offline optimum. Each element has one independent sample paired with an identically distributed nonnegative online value, and all coordinates are independent. The rule and finite seed law depend only on the labeled matroid; choices are irrevocable and feasible after every prefix. The arrival order may depend measurably on all samples, values, and the seed, and only the offline optimum must be integrable.\n\nA supporting hidden-vector selection result for fixed nonnegative matroid weights gives expected worst-order reward at least $2^{-293}$ times the optimum, again with a finite seed law and prefix feasibility.","title":"One-sample matroid prophet inequalities against an almighty adversary","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/docs/111.md"}},"provenance":{"kind":"computed-navigation","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","repository":"https://github.com/openai/math","rule":"Projection of the pinned ledger; no new mathematical assessment."},"reader_comparison":{"headline_coverage":"agree","method":"Compare reported scope categories; notes remain attributed and are not adjudicated.","points":[{"definitions_to_check":null,"gap":null,"note":null,"reading":"reading:6f7006ce46b1efe4ff8f72da","source_term":"MATCHES","state":"all"},{"definitions_to_check":null,"gap":null,"note":"None; the hidden-vector selection result (constant 2^{-293}) is an extra supporting statement.","reading":"reading:4f3a0f3a50124d58c99ea7ad","source_term":"full","state":"all"}],"readings":["reading:6f7006ce46b1efe4ff8f72da","reading:4f3a0f3a50124d58c99ea7ad"],"state":"agree"},"reading